## About

When creating a Production application with Enable Banking, users may be required to provide publicly accessible URLs for a Privacy Policy and Terms of Use.

This repository provides simple templates intended for people who use Actual Budget privately for personal or household financial management.

The templates can be copied, modified, and adapted to individual setups.

## Using these templates

Before using either document:

1. Read the complete document.
2. Make sure it accurately describes your Actual Budget setup.
3. Adapt it where necessary.
